+The organization's work status settings. `desktopAuth`; not a
+`member`-middleware route: the service reads the caller's membership itself on
+every request, like `orgMembers.ts`. A non-member (or an unknown
+organization) answers 404 `not_found`.
+
+GET answers:
+
+```json
+{
+    "shareWorkStatus": true,
+    "canManage": true,
+    "personal": false,
+    "linearWorkspaces": ["acme"]
+}
+```
+
+`shareWorkStatus` defaults to true and `linearWorkspaces` to `[]` when the
+organization has no settings row. `canManage` is true for an owner or admin of
+a non-personal organization. A personal organization never shares, so it
+answers `shareWorkStatus: false`, `canManage: false`, `personal: true` and
+`linearWorkspaces: []`.
+
+POST takes a strict body with at least one of:
+
+- `shareWorkStatus`: boolean;
+- `linearWorkspaces`: an array of at most 10 strings, each lower-cased and
+  then `^[a-z0-9-]{1,64}$` (the `<workspace>` of `linear.app/<workspace>`),
+  stored deduplicated in first-seen order; `[]` clears it.
+
+A field not sent keeps its value. The body is at most 4 KiB. Checked in
+this order: non-member 404 `not_found`; not owner or admin 403
+`forbidden`; personal organization 400 `work_status_personal_organization`;
+a bad body (empty, an unknown key, a wrong type, a bad or 11th workspace,
+or over 4 KiB) 400 `work_claims_invalid_request`. Stores the change with
+`updated_by` and `updated_at`, and answers like GET.
+
+## Error codes
+
+| Status | Code                                | When                                                    |
+| ------ | ----------------------------------- | ------------------------------------------------------- |
+| 400    | `work_claims_invalid_request`       | any validation failure, bad JSON, a body over its limit |
+| 400    | `work_status_personal_organization` | POST work-status in a personal organization             |
+| 401    | `unauthorized`                      | no desktop session                                      |
+| 403    | `forbidden`                         | POST work-status by a member who is not owner or admin  |
+| 404    | `not_found`                         | work-status of an organization the caller is not in     |
+| 409    | `work_claims_device_limit`          | a new device beyond 10 with live claims                 |
+| 429    | `work_claims_rate_limited`          | a PUT within 2 s of the device's last (`Retry-After`)   |
+| 500    | `work_claims_internal_error`        | anything unexpected                                     |
 
